# Files that run with release credentials. "Protect main" and "Protect release branches"
# require a code owner's review, so a writer cannot merge a change that reads the release
# App key, the macOS signing secrets or the Homebrew deploy key without the maintainer.
# See docs-internal/maintenance/ci-and-releases.md#release-credentials.

# Workflows, the setup action, Renovate's policy and this file.
/.github/ @quwisky

# Scripts the release, back-merge, backport and Homebrew jobs run.
/scripts/ @quwisky
/tools/release-please/ @quwisky

# What the macOS signing job installs and loads next to the signing certificate.
